---

---

<section
	id="firma"
	class="relative bg-slate-50 py-16 text-slate-900 sm:py-20 lg:py-24"
>
	<div
		class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 hidden w-24 bg-[#080e21] h-[40%] sm:block lg:w-32"
	>
	</div>
	<div
		class="absolute right-0 top-0 hidden w-24 bg-[#00bcff] h-[40%] sm:block lg:w-32"
	>
	</div>

	<div
		class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-8"
	>
		<div
			class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/10 lg:w-[46%]"
		>
			<div
				class="absolute -left-24 top-0 h-full w-40 -skew-x-6 bg-sky-500/90 sm:-left-28 lg:-left-32"
			>
			</div>
			<img
				src="/public/images/section01.webp"
				alt="Equipo legal en reunión"
				class="relative z-10 h-full w-full object-cover"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-10 w-full lg:w-[54%]">
			<h2 class="text-2xl tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-500 sm:text-3xl">
				<span class="lang-es">NUESTRA FIRMA</span>
				<span class="lang-en">OUR FIRM</span>
			</h2>
			<div class="mt-3 h-0.5 w-20 bg-sky-500"></div>

			<div
				class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 sm:text-base"
			>
				<p class="lang-es">
					World Solved Case es una firma de servicios legales y
					consultoría estratégica dedicada a potenciar el valor de los
					negocios y proyectos de nuestros clientes. Con sede en Santo
					Domingo y un alcance global, ofrecemos soluciones integrales
					tanto para individuos como para corporaciones. 
				</p>
				<p class="lang-es">
					Bajo un
					modelo de eficiencia y excelencia operativa, nuestro equipo
					proporciona acompañamiento legal preventivo y ejecución
					práctica en todas las etapas de desarrollo de sus planes,
					garantizando seguridad jurídica en sus áreas de mayor
					interés.
				</p>

				<p class="lang-en">
					World Solved Case is a law firm and strategic consulting company dedicated to enhancing the value of our clients' businesses and projects. Based in Santo Domingo with a global reach, we offer comprehensive solutions for both individuals and corporations.
				</p>
				<p class="lang-en">
					Under a model of efficiency and operational excellence, our team provides preventive legal support and practical execution at every stage of your plans’ development, ensuring legal security in your most relevant interests.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
